  idQuest: 4
  tenNhiemVu: "M\u1ED9c Tinh Bi\u1EBFn D\u1EA1ng"
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "Ma kh\xED lan r\u1ED9ng \u0111\xE3 c\u1EAFn nu\u1ED1t c\u1EA3
    linh kh\xED c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng c\xE2y tr\xFAc c\u1ED5 th\u1EE5, bi\u1EBFn ch\xFAng
    th\xE0nh qu\xE1i c\xE2y \u0103n th\u1ECBt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. Ch\xFAng qu\u1EA5n
    r\u1EC5 kh\u1EAFp l\u1ED1i \u0111i ch\xEDnh. H\xE3y gi\xFAp ch\xFAng t\xF4i \u0111\u1ED1n
    g\u1EE5c b\u1EA7y m\u1ED9c tinh qu\u1EF7 qu\xE1i n\xE0y!"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "L\u0169 qu\xE1i c\xE2y n\xE0y \u1EA9n n\u1EA5p r\u1EA5t k\u1EF9
    trong r\u1EEBng m\u1ED9c. Ng\xE0i h\xE3y c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn l\u1EDBp gi\xE1p
    th\xE2n c\xE2y c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng v\xE0 ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EE7 12 c\xE2y
    tinh nh\xE9!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "C\xE2y c\u1ED1i \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EDF l\u1EA1i tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i
    b\xECnh th\u01B0\u1EDDng, ma kh\xED t\xE0n d\u01B0 tr\xEAn c\xE1c g\u1ED1c c\u1ED5
    th\u1EE5 c\u0169ng d\u1EA7n tan bi\u1EBFn. B\xE1 t\xE1nh ghi \u01A1n ng\xE0i
    v\xF4 c\xF9ng!"
